  "description": "Our lawn mower tires feature a unique tread pattern design that reduces lawn damage by increasing friction between the tire and the ground. Additionally, this design helps to reduce tire noise and enhances the tire’s cooling and drainage capability, improving overall vehicle handling.\nFitment\nThese lawn mower tires are compatible with a variety of vehicles, including lawn mowers, riding lawn mowers, lawn tractors, golf carts and garden tractors.\nFeatures\nSpecifications: Tire Size: 18x8.50-8\", Tire Load Range: 4PR/B, Tread Depth: 0.28\"/7.1mm, Rim Width: 7\", Section Width: 8.2\"/210mm, Outer Diameter: 17.75\"/455mm, Max Load: 815Lbs@22 psi; Non-highway use\nFeatures: Unique tread pattern design greatly reduces damage to your lawn by providing dependable traction when working on turf, particularly on hills and inclines\nCompatibility: Our 18x8.50-8, 18x8.5x8, and 18x8.5-8 lawn mower tires are compatible with lawn mowers, riding lawn mowers, lawn tractors, and garden tractors\nPackage: Includes set of 2 18x8.50-8\" lawn mower tires that are suitable for lawnmowers, motorcycles, garden tractors, golf carts, and farm equipment; Wheel not included\nNote: Before purchasing, please check the size of your existing tire's sidewall, rim, and tread depth to ensure proper fit; Our team is ready to assist with any questions",
